# Golden /metrics snapshot — multi-model / multi-bucket scenario.
# Replays *-multi.json/.xml provider-payload fixtures through the publisher
# and asserts that each of these substring lines is present in the scrape.
# Counters absent from this list (e.g. requests_total for Anthropic) are
# intentionally omitted by the mapper for that provider.

